OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers at first,
OL,7,Fheavy at times, but these gradually
OL,8,Ffading out through the evening.
OL,9,FIncreasingly cloudy with the odd light
OL,10,Fshower overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with dry spells and
OL,13,Fa scattering of generally light
OL,14,Fshowers at first. Some bright spells
OL,15,Fand the odd heavy shower possible in
OL,16,Fthe afternoon. Breezy in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
